# The scope manifest of broiler.webassembly.slice over the pinned suite: the scripts a run of that manifest selects.
# Read by the harness root's --spec lane with --scope; see SpecSelection.cs. Every script of the pinned revision is
# listed. Scoping a script out - one whose modules all import, say - is a decision for WA-4's owner and is not
# taken here, so the scripts the manifest cannot pass are in scope and their failures are in the queue.
manifest broiler.webassembly.slice
file address.wast
file align.wast
file binary-leb128.wast
file binary.wast
file block.wast
file br.wast
file br_if.wast
file br_table.wast
file break-drop.wast
file call.wast
